<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Sistem Yönetim Özeti — Enterprise ERP</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    .exec-kpi-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .exec-kpi-card {
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 22px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .exec-kpi-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
    }
    .exec-kpi-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);
    }
    .exec-kpi-icon {
      width: 48px; height: 48px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.12);
      color: #818cf8;
      border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25);
    }
    .exec-kpi-val { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--text-primary); line-height: 1; }
    .exec-kpi-lbl { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 700; margin-top: 4px; }

    .ops-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .op-card {
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      text-decoration: none;
      display: block;
      transition: all 0.25 ease;
      position: relative;
    }
    .op-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: #6366f1;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
    }
    .op-card-icon {
      width: 42px; height: 42px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .op-card-title { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .op-card-desc { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.4; }
  </style>
  <script src="/sidebar.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body class="module-body">
  <!-- Module Sidebar -->
  <aside class="module-sidebar">
    <div class="module-sidebar-brand">
      <a href="/" class="msb-logo">
        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><rect width="32" height="32" rx="8" fill="url(#bGrad)"/><path d="M8 12h16M8 16h12M8 20h8" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><defs><linearGradient id="bGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="32" y2="32"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#6366f1"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#8b5cf6"/></linearGradient></defs></svg>
        <span>Enterprise ERP</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="module-sidebar-section">
      <div class="mss-label">🛡️ SİSTEM YÖNETİMİ & GÜVENLİK</div>

      <div class="mss-group-title">📊 KONTROL PANELİ & ANALİTİK</div>
      <div class="mss-sub">
        <a href="/admin" class="mss-sub-link active">📊 Yönetim Özeti</a>
      </div>

      <div class="mss-group-title">👥 KULLANICI & ROL YÖNETİMİ</div>
      <div class="mss-sub">
        <a href="/admin/users" class="mss-sub-link">👥 Kullanıcı Hesapları</a>
        <a href="/admin/users/add" class="mss-sub-link">➕ Yeni Kullanıcı Ekle</a>
        <a href="/admin/roles" class="mss-sub-link">🔐 Rol & Yetki Matrisi</a>
      </div>

      <div class="mss-group-title">⚙️ SİSTEM & GÜVENLİK AYARLARI</div>
      <div class="mss-sub">
        <a href="/admin/settings" class="mss-sub-link">⚙️ Sistem Parametreleri</a>
        <a href="/admin/logs" class="mss-sub-link">📜 İşlem Günlüğü (Audit Log)</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="module-sidebar-user">
      <div class="msu-avatar"><%= user.username.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %></div>
      <div class="msu-meta">
        <strong><%= user.firstName ? user.firstName + ' ' + user.lastName : user.username %></strong>
        <span><%= user.role %></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <!-- Main Area -->
  <div class="module-main">
    <header class="module-topbar">
      <div class="mt-left">
        <a href="/" class="mt-link">Ana Sayfa</a>
        <a href="/admin" class="mt-link active">Sistem Yönetimi</a>
        <a href="/stock" class="mt-link">Stok & Depo</a>
        <a href="/sales" class="mt-link">Satış Yönetimi</a>
        <a href="/purchase" class="mt-link">Satın Alma</a>
        <a href="/production" class="mt-link">Üretim Planlama</a><a href="/quality" class="mt-link">Kalite Kontrol</a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-right">
        <span class="mt-time" id="liveTime"></span>
        <a href="/logout" class="mt-logout" title="Çıkış">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4"/><polyline points="16 17 21 12 16 7"/><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="9" y2="12"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="module-content">

      <div class="page-header">
        <div>
          <h1>Kurumsal Sistem Yönetim Özeti</h1>
          <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 4px;">Canlı sistem durumu, aktif kullanıcı metrikleri, yetkilendirme mimarisi ve güvenlik parametreleri.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Executive KPI Cards -->
      <div class="exec-kpi-grid">
        <div class="exec-kpi-card">
          <div class="exec-kpi-icon">👥</div>
          <div>
            <div class="exec-kpi-val"><%= userCount %></div>
            <div class="exec-kpi-lbl">Toplam Kayıtlı Kullanıcı</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="exec-kpi-card">
          <div class="exec-kpi-icon" style="background: rgba(16,185,129,0.15); color: #34d399; border-color: rgba(16,185,129,0.3);">✅</div>
          <div>
            <div class="exec-kpi-val" style="color: #34d399;"><%= activeUsersCount %></div>
            <div class="exec-kpi-lbl">Aktif Personel Hesabı</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="exec-kpi-card">
          <div class="exec-kpi-icon" style="background: rgba(14,165,233,0.15); color: #38bdf8; border-color: rgba(14,165,233,0.3);">🛡️</div>
          <div>
            <div class="exec-kpi-val" style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #38bdf8; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;">JWT + RBAC</div>
            <div class="exec-kpi-lbl">Rol Tabanlı Yetki Mimarisi</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="exec-kpi-card">
          <div class="exec-kpi-icon" style="background: rgba(245,158,11,0.15); color: #fbbf24; border-color: rgba(245,158,11,0.3);">⚙️</div>
          <div>
            <div class="exec-kpi-val" style="color: #fbbf24;"><%= settings ? settings.length : 0 %></div>
            <div class="exec-kpi-lbl">Sistem Parametresi</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Operations Grid -->
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 16px;">⚡ Sistem Yönetim İşlemleri ve Erişim Hızlı Linkleri</h3>
      <div class="ops-grid">
        <a href="/admin/users" class="op-card">
          <div class="op-card-icon">👥</div>
          <div class="op-card-title">Kullanıcı Hesapları Yönetimi</div>
          <div class="op-card-desc">Sistem kullanıcılarını listeleyin, hesap durumlarını dondurun veya şifrelerini sıfırlayın.</div>
        </a>

        <a href="/admin/users/add" class="op-card">
          <div class="op-card-icon" style="background: rgba(16,185,129,0.15); color: #34d399;">➕</div>
          <div class="op-card-title">Yeni Kullanıcı Hesabı Ekle</div>
          <div class="op-card-desc">Departman, unvan ve sistem rolü belirleyerek yeni kurumsal personel hesabı açın.</div>
        </a>

        <a href="/admin/roles" class="op-card">
          <div class="op-card-icon" style="background: rgba(139,92,246,0.15); color: #a78bfa;">🔐</div>
          <div class="op-card-title">Rol ve Yetki Matrisi</div>
          <div class="op-card-desc">Hangi kullanıcı rolünün hangi ERP modüllerini ve ekranlarını görebileceğini yönetin.</div>
        </a>

        <a href="/admin/settings" class="op-card">
          <div class="op-card-icon" style="background: rgba(245,158,11,0.15); color: #fbbf24;">⚙️</div>
          <div class="op-card-title">Sistem Parametreleri</div>
          <div class="op-card-desc">Oturum zaman aşımı, şifre kuralları, şirket unvanı ve çalışma ayarlarını düzenleyin.</div>
        </a>

        <a href="/admin/logs" class="op-card">
          <div class="op-card-icon" style="background: rgba(99,102,241,0.15); color: #818cf8;">📜</div>
          <div class="op-card-title">İşlem Günlüğü & Loglar</div>
          <div class="op-card-desc">Kullanıcıların ERP sisteminde gerçekleştirdiği ekleme, güncelleme ve silme logları.</div>
        </a>

        <a href="/stock" class="op-card">
          <div class="op-card-icon" style="background: rgba(6,182,212,0.15); color: #22d3ee;">📦</div>
          <div class="op-card-title">Stok & Depo Modülü</div>
          <div class="op-card-desc">Envanter stok kartları, depolar arası sevk, sayım fişleri ve envanter analitiği.</div>
        </a>

        <a href="/production" class="op-card">
          <div class="op-card-icon" style="background: rgba(236,72,153,0.15); color: #f472b6;">🏭</div>
          <div class="op-card-title">Üretim Planlama Modülü</div>
          <div class="op-card-desc">Fabrika iş emirleri, MRP malzeme ihtiyaç motoru, ürün reçeteleri (BOM) ve rotalama.</div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>

  <script>
    function updateClock() { const now = new Date(); const el = document.getElementById('liveTime'); if (el) el.textContent = now.toLocaleDateString('tr-TR', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long' }) + ' • ' + now.toLocaleTimeString('tr-TR', { hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' }); }
    updateClock(); setInterval(updateClock, 1000);
  </script>
</body>
</html>
